@startuml
title Analyze price and discount (ASUC-01, evidence)
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow false
participant "Shopper" as P0 #edf1f5
participant "Shopper Client" as P1 #eaf2ff
participant "Shopping API" as P2 #fff3df
participant "Price Evidence" as P3 #fff3df
participant "Data Store" as P4 #f3edff
participant "Forecast Service" as P5 #fff3df
P0 -> P1 : Open laptop details(productId)
activate P1
P1 -> P2 : getInsights(productId)
activate P2
P2 -> P3 : getEvidence(productId)
activate P3
P3 -> P4 : Read current offers and 30-day observations
activate P4
P4 --> P3 : Dated observations, retailer and provenance
deactivate P4
P3 -> P3 : Derive daily lowest valid offer (comparable currency)
P3 -> P3 : reference := median of daily lowest offers; delta := price / reference - 1
alt enough observation days and valid current offer
P3 -> P3 : Mark evidence SUFFICIENT
else insufficient evidence
P3 -> P3 : Mark INSUFFICIENT_DATA; keep observed prices
end
P3 --> P2 : Offers, history, reference, delta, sufficiency
deactivate P3
P2 -> P5 : getLatest(productId)
activate P5
P5 -> P4 : Read latest stored 7-day forecast
P4 --> P5 : Forecast run / none
P5 -> P5 : Compare forecast age with freshness limit
P5 --> P2 : Forecast and status FRESH | STALE | MISSING
deactivate P5
P2 -> P2 : Assemble Past, Present, Future with timestamps and caveats
P2 --> P1 : Insights
deactivate P2
P1 --> P0 : Show chart, source and uncertainty
deactivate P1
@enduml
